@name     rec_trim_reset
@alias    w*
@group    voice
@c_name   skode_clause_rec_trim_reset_0
@type     immediate
@arity    0
@match    ()
@summary  reset recording buffer trim points
@doc
Resets recording buffer start offset and end trim to 0.
Usage: w*
@code
    return skode_exec_w_star(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end

